// Points and coupons at a coffee shop. Points add up to each customer's total, and a coupon is shown until used but not added to the total.
cards Coffee shop points and coupons

box shop as Coffee shop [note: Issuer]
box mina as Mina [note: Member]
box ken as Ken [note: Not a member]

item p1 as Stamps in mina [amount: 120 pt]
item c1 as Next-visit coupon in mina [amount: 200 yen, total: none]

step Use points
  say Mina spends 100 pt on a coffee. The other 20 pt move to a new card.
  shop -> p1: Take 100 pt
  delete p1
  item p2 as Stamps in mina [amount: 20 pt]

step Use the coupon
  say A used coupon is gone. It was not in the total, so Mina's total stays the same.
  mina -> c1: Use
  delete c1

step Send Ken a coupon
  say Ken is not a member, so he cannot receive a coupon.
  refuse ken: Not a member
